  // Works standalone (sorkrimp's original sheets) and next to a Childhood Sweetheart Caroline mod ("Enable Childhood Sweetheart Caroline Compatibility").
  // "Enable Custom Outfits for Sweetheart Caroline" LAYERS the alt outfits on top of this file
  // (assets/Immersive_Additions/Outfits/Caroline_Sweetheart/Caroline_Sweetheart.json).
  //
  // Names: PWR-owned assets are Portraits|Characters/Caroline_Sweetheart_<X> (APF variant Sweetheart_<X>).
  // Precedence map (lowest wins):
  //   Beach Bikinis patch -2200 | Improved Luau patch -2500 | pyjamas -1150 | island -1120 |
  //   specials -1110 (aerobics, festivals, swim, wedding) | CSC specials -1100 |
  //   seasons -140 | CSC seasons -130
  // Cutscene sheets: APF VariantEvents in Caroline_Sweetheart_Base.json (APF pack).
  // ==========================================================================================
  "Changes": [
